ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 35% of normal in January to February and 163% in July to August. So far in 2026 February to March came in at 25% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 25633 had its driest year in 2022 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
